            <div xml:id="m-51864c18-6b5b-4eea-9f39-1e159adf93bf">
              <lg xml:id="m-7ee058b0-f45f-480e-9192-d81e27b096e3">
                <l xml:id="m-74361c9f-8db2-4d0f-8d07-c6c58e8985c1" facs="#m-335f2c87-3164-4914-b591-530179ca069e" label="ambiguous">s4s</l><l xml:id="m-8256806c-0330-4bc4-8245-58c9f695778a" facs="#m-7f24e3c6-2a87-4786-aac9-82edd581b164" label="text-like">and Sunday of Lent.</l><l xml:id="m-f55dd534-72cc-4fee-8870-cfc080b2d537" facs="#m-6d8423ee-975c-4a2d-89ea-7d758a7bf8e4" label="lyrics-like">unt judí¬</l><l xml:id="m-eb3313a1-e881-461f-a56e-4075379bef64" facs="#m-958da28a-fb65-445b-b46a-dd12aafef1e8" label="lyrics-like">qui custó-di¬</l><l xml:id="m-7651b88e-d7be-4a1b-a8cf-df98bcccb1c2" facs="#m-08b26999-828a-4e37-a31b-8afd2018098c" label="lyrics-like">in ómni</l><l xml:id="m-966179f0-9c7e-42a9-b574-7783df987c37" facs="#m-a14a7aa3-2732-4b33-b808-629781c33d70" label="lyrics-like">et fáci-unt justí- ti-am</l><l xml:id="m-65f87a5d-4c08-4ad6-bdc4-9eb872b19c16" facs="#m-71782b29-084e-487d-90bd-e6acc3aa60a2" label="ambiguous">ci-um,</l><l xml:id="m-98217408-2abf-4152-8366-e47f5b9f78b6" facs="#m-2220fde9-9158-416c-9518-55c3154e7ae9" label="lyrics-like">V. Memén-to</l><l xml:id="m-0a743ecd-d02d-4b70-ae65-7a19711e2f5a" facs="#m-505483c9-b570-4d4d-bb16-29ec2b0e0927" label="lyrics-like">tém-po-re.</l><l xml:id="m-b3b01fd7-d378-4fa3-9b1f-10726871a05e" facs="#m-1a2a3861-aaa1-4e86-a6a8-5fcfae9847c5" label="lyrics-like">nóstri, Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-9d0d9f41-2d71-43e0-969f-ba0c195a6564" facs="#m-21794267-08b4-4053-b610-2c8eb115292b" label="lyrics-like">in benepláci-to pópu-li tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-0eb61907-3d45-47a9-a87e-dd8d326e326d" facs="#m-03616165-30ca-4a0e-ad5f-cf2eb66497c2" label="ambiguous">ne,</l><l xml:id="m-e4cdd4a7-c32c-444d-bac4-92f6b3a73b6f" facs="#m-b348dc7a-04d9-477d-a404-fe825a1ac250" label="lyrics-like">ví-si-ta</l><l xml:id="m-30bee369-b2ac-4174-8683-c528f02e5892" facs="#m-e505200b-80cf-41f7-8e77-181c7ae08493" label="ambiguous">i</l><l xml:id="m-036c3522-f633-4987-a2ed-f179b7e2ba5a" facs="#m-87478f72-716a-478b-bd2b-cdaa5a5cb1c5" label="lyrics-like">in sa¬ lu-tá¬ ri</l><l xml:id="m-c859676c-fae2-44db-9bc3-2238570f9327" facs="#m-b4aa5a9b-81f9-405f-8e97-76303144bfe6" label="ambiguous">nos</l><l xml:id="m-bdef2c5b-2bdc-455a-ab10-17b91555b1d5" facs="#m-a12664f1-b399-4b0e-b46e-b33be6cc3f1f" label="lyrics-like">tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-b4f9fff2-b276-4567-b165-4c5ea3219483" facs="#m-21056888-2d39-4635-be4a-fff526883bcd" label="ambiguous">o.</l><l xml:id="m-1c550e28-2d8e-4e39-92c7-dc3fee5b356d" facs="#m-48fdad24-a3ba-4fc3-a1a7-d6e4865f0c41" label="ambiguous">† Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Matthaeum.</l><l xml:id="m-6b8404c7-ce4f-4437-937e-84731575ce29" facs="#m-60cee3c3-026b-44cf-b712-d517f7d1775b" label="ambiguous">Matth. 17.</l><l xml:id="m-c4533310-6186-4788-bffe-4be8879ff86b" facs="#m-35e145e5-c074-4357-9bea-216a89c57e41" label="lyrics-like">N illo témpore: Assúmpsit Jesus l ecce vox de nube, dicens: Hic est</l><l xml:id="m-3af652a8-ab56-44b0-b186-86f69ec46190" facs="#m-0ca9a058-a48e-4a78-ae3d-816771b4a595" label="lyrics-like">L Petrum, et Jacóbum, et Joánnem</l><l xml:id="m-d2702888-ba99-435b-a006-6350e3e37531" facs="#m-0cd26b0f-033c-446d-8ff6-f4ec47edfccd" label="lyrics-like">Filius meus diléctus, in quo mihi</l><l xml:id="m-d81ef2f1-817b-4509-b452-a3435991841a" facs="#m-70e00fb8-bbc3-4a9f-9351-5ac0ccf49230" label="ambiguous">fratrem ejus, et duxit illos in mon¬</l><l xml:id="m-0be22020-8f17-4676-8c5e-47c7def60beb" facs="#m-50b79615-6dcc-4c03-934d-6b95c35839a4" label="lyrics-like">bene complácui: ipsum audite. Et</l><l xml:id="m-bda43da9-25fb-4608-a704-16b819c2ec23" facs="#m-84d990fa-72ba-41ac-833a-a61f2df55ab9" label="lyrics-like">tem excélsum seórsum: et transfi¬</l><l xml:id="m-f03e54d3-d5f2-4201-bf04-873374cfdf23" facs="#m-864e2324-dfee-4ae5-b12e-c57c8ad89153" label="lyrics-like">audiéntes discipuli, cecidérunt in</l><l xml:id="m-d7b30b92-1e63-4886-b49d-ac2ca9e38191" facs="#m-69514a57-371f-444c-95af-03aa3874bc0b" label="lyrics-like">gurátus est ante eos. Et resplénduit</l><l xml:id="m-cc0f8e59-2d75-4125-bc32-211d31457410" facs="#m-13435d22-91b7-45c3-9de7-31ae2db885b5" label="lyrics-like">fáciem suam, et timuérunt valde.</l><l xml:id="m-07454e16-c80a-451c-9d9e-a3dad40fba6b" facs="#m-34b6d06e-9e50-4f40-b977-ae6989f8f38e" label="lyrics-like">Et accéssit Jesus, et tétigit eos,</l><l xml:id="m-c8e5e047-86c6-478e-be99-47e8c91c9556" facs="#m-c79a8a0e-6164-44c9-a3ad-49101ff4e378" label="lyrics-like">fácies ejus sicut sol: vestiménta</l><l xml:id="m-9c45a5f4-817e-453e-87b7-bb709d68c320" facs="#m-81a2852c-849d-4161-bc38-04e6aa1d9aa2" label="ambiguous">autem ejus facta sunt alba sicut nix.</l><l xml:id="m-eff9e8e2-361c-4642-91e9-ec21f4b66fc2" facs="#m-ebea0a24-dd5d-4072-b054-6d97d05a5b4f" label="lyrics-like">dixitque eis: Súrgite, et nolite ti¬</l><l xml:id="m-524a2bcd-1882-478b-b9ec-635e5ce80990" facs="#m-9edef89e-6aaf-4396-98c2-70f9dc836f19" label="lyrics-like">Et ecce apparuérunt illis Móyses</l><l xml:id="m-977ab7df-22c5-45cc-a7ec-cb356191179b" facs="#m-3b410a9f-c45e-4df6-bf30-94b7741054d9" label="lyrics-like">mére. Levántes autem óculos suos,</l><l xml:id="m-6afede5d-99e7-4fd7-ae05-9591899a34b4" facs="#m-23c80f03-3ff1-4434-9431-63ec92e8de6a" label="lyrics-like">et Elias cum eo loquéntes. Respón¬</l><l xml:id="m-d60a0e08-e977-4535-a87b-0d5b6e651bc5" facs="#m-fba95408-e97c-49c3-881e-a84a4f52cb1e" label="lyrics-like">néminem vidérunt, nisi solum Je¬</l><l xml:id="m-da8010c2-2c60-4485-af3a-d5afb80810d9" facs="#m-01dc03de-8c99-46ee-bdca-6c06ad7c6143" label="lyrics-like">sum. Et descendéntibus illis de</l><l xml:id="m-c07d5375-941a-423f-a293-7e8007bd5715" facs="#m-472fac9a-c60a-470a-bf65-f6f343ab7f63" label="ambiguous">dens autem Petrus, dixit ad lesum:</l><l xml:id="m-5d3c55be-4d85-4195-b2e4-b98be1c49715" facs="#m-2baa86fd-a6ba-44d7-ae30-5e48ea8b5744" label="lyrics-like">Dómine, bonum est nos hic esse: si</l><l xml:id="m-83ae44fc-5410-45ad-a4c1-e9af954050d4" facs="#m-5e7644bb-676f-4284-aeb8-686f4385ef1c" label="lyrics-like">monte, praecépit eis lesus, dicens:</l><l xml:id="m-2cc0bdd8-e41e-4a8a-9575-c5854ced927b" facs="#m-cd094530-0950-4074-8580-64bb1cb252ce" label="lyrics-like">vis, faciámus hic tria tabernácula,</l><l xml:id="m-208a512c-5725-490d-ae61-3cde1a50525f" facs="#m-2d37444a-da41-4ebf-901d-9dff79cdc874" label="lyrics-like">Némini dixéritis visiónem, donec</l><l xml:id="m-a7611421-ef43-4709-9741-81cc8df0f707" facs="#m-eb8e9313-8d91-49e8-a925-27651fbffca0" label="lyrics-like">tibi unum, Móysi unum, et Eliae</l><l xml:id="m-03536dcd-e21b-48e7-915c-8fe39951ff9a" facs="#m-e68a123f-a25f-4029-b21c-32973f10c51d" label="lyrics-like">Filius hóminis a mórtuis resúrgat</l><l xml:id="m-a4891df5-73f3-495c-b4e5-4342056df44e" facs="#m-b22d2fde-8d62-49df-81c9-f2aa177705b9" label="lyrics-like">unum. Adhuc eo loquénte, ecce</l><l xml:id="m-5eebe94e-8fe5-4f5e-a293-4af5f9bb08ef" facs="#m-220c0e34-bbef-43ef-816d-93cdcaa787b0" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-5a494b36-d59a-474a-b9c8-63c2f0ff3179" facs="#m-1f0f64b8-c2d9-4a48-aee8-9260854c33a3" label="lyrics-like">nubes lúcida obumbrávit eos. Et</l><l xml:id="m-659f215b-9d6f-4740-9c5d-35c5c0dc6aea" facs="#m-776d8bc6-62d8-4ef8-b3f8-9494272fb559" label="ambiguous">ofrert.</l><l xml:id="m-d0818782-17ea-48fd-ba31-994c73207670" facs="#m-6a9f3305-5c59-421d-b6b4-4334a50c8f43" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-b808327f-0bef-4f77-ab9d-959abb793471" facs="#m-69b45a6c-e4a9-4cbc-a9be-953f3e1b0c6d" label="ambiguous">m</l><l xml:id="m-93c66c14-1820-4a53-a76c-9d9c0a11757e" facs="#m-38f23620-3c51-411b-b28c-1e2d846a75a6" label="lyrics-like">Edi-tá¬</l><l xml:id="m-f903df45-9320-485d-8cc3-98cb3fd77316" facs="#m-05330a56-9bee-45ce-ac5b-1bc3fc65cefe" label="ambiguous">bor</l><l xml:id="m-a79ca29d-d374-426e-a71d-1d0ffba6c611" facs="#m-cb4914bc-8102-4461-a04d-d92e57799a4a" label="lyrics-like">tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-b10fcda3-ede7-48a2-bff7-4872b051b82e" facs="#m-f3d48311-29a3-432f-8e17-c390d093a362" label="lyrics-like">in mandá- tis</l><l xml:id="m-d3f45703-fa46-498a-81db-5af43a2f9b08" facs="#m-391b12ad-7183-4b37-b8bb-7549ed2f3c3e" label="text-like">is,</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>